 e Cafe. Grab some dinner and enjoy the music in the Picnic Grove with fam
 ily and friends.\n\nJuly 25: City Sun\n\nAugust 22: UltraFab\n\nTicket De
 tails:\n\nZoo Members: Free!\n\nBecome a Zoo Member Here\n\nGeneral Admis
 sion Adults (15-61): $16\n\nGeneral Admission Seniors (62+): $14\n\nGener
 al Admission Child (3-14): $14\n\nGeneral Admission Babies (0-2): Free\n\
 nBuy Admission Tickets Online or At The Gate\n\nMore Info: https://www.vi
 sitsouthbend.com/events/2026-zoo-nights-live-2/
