BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d43ca3486ca9c2a5065ded86@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260822T074657Z
SUMMARY:ACTOR’S CUT: LITTLE SHOP OF HORRORS
LOCATION:Morris Performing Arts Center | 211 N Michigan St | South Bend\, 4
 6601
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Actor’s Cut screening of "Little Shop of Horr
 ors" to celebrate its 40th anniversary\, hosted by Ellen Greene\, the ori
 ginal Audrey from the iconic stage musical and beloved film adaptation. T
 his special event features a rare appearance by Greene\, along with exclu
 sive meet-and-greet packages that include signed memorabilia and photo op
 portunities. "Little Shop of Horrors\," directed by Frank Oz\, is a cult-
 classic sci-fi musical comedy about Seymour Krelborn\, a nerdy florist wh
 o nurtures a man-eating plant named Audrey II. As the plant's fame grows\
 , it demands human sacrifices\, putting Seymour’s love for coworker Aud
 rey at risk. Don’t miss this unforgettable experience!\n\nMore Info: ht
 tps://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/actors-cut-little-shop-of-horrors/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/actors-cut-little-shop-of-horrors
 /
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T203000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:43364cbce1b6ce79e989d15a@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260822T074657Z
SUMMARY:ARMAN SANGALANG QUINTET
LOCATION:Merrimans' Playhouse | 401 E. Colfax\, Suite 135 | South Bend\, IN
  46617
DESCRIPTION:The Arman Sangalang Quartet is an ensemble that balances intric
 ate compositions rooted in jazz with genre-bending improvisation to creat
 e a landscape of modern textures and soundscapes. The quartet features Ch
 icago saxophonist\, Arman Sangalang. He is joined by an all-star rhythm s
 ection of the Midwest’s finest improvisors: Dave Miller (guitar)\, Kati
 e Ernst (Bass)\, and Devin Drobka (drums). Primarily based in Chicago\, t
 he group is excited to embark on a Midwest tour to celebrate the release 
 of Sangalang’s debut album\, “Quartet” on Calligram Records.\n\nArm
 an Sangalang – saxophone\n\nDave Miller – guitar\n\nKatie Ernst - bas
 s\n\nDevin Drobka – drums\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/
 events/arman-sangalang-quintet/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/arman-sangalang-quintet/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260826T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260826T210000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
