BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:102f6da1a4972847da497ba2@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260822T074657Z
SUMMARY:BLITHE SPIRIT
LOCATION:South Bend Civic Theater | 403 N Main St | South Bend\, 46601
DESCRIPTION:In this classic comedy\, novelist Charles Condomine — hoping 
 to get material for his new book — invites medium Madame Arcati into hi
 s home. Instead of literary inspiration\, the eccentric medium conjures E
 lvira\, Charles’s mischievous and very deceased first wife.\n\nWillful 
 and temperamental in life and death\, Elvira proceeds to create hilarious
 \, haunting havoc as she attempts to sabotage Charles’s relationship wi
 th his current wife\, Ruth\, through a series of increasingly chaotic eve
 nts.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/blithe-spirit-4/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/blithe-spirit-4/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T213000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
