BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8f36a6daaadf8f13ef69052d@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260822T074657Z
SUMMARY:SOUTH BEND CUBS VS. WEST MICHIGAN WHITECAPS
LOCATION:Four Winds Field | 501 W South St | South Bend\, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:Game Highlights:\n\nFallen Heroes Day\n\nJoin us as we honor ou
 r fallen heroes and award the Corporal Paul Deguch Community Service Awar
 d to a South Bend Cubs player who demonstrates outstanding community serv
 ice.\n\nSpecial Appearance: Zooperstars\n\nCome see the hilarious inflata
 ble characters like Harry Canary\, Tommy Laswordfish\, Ken Giraffey\, Jr.
 \, Nolan Rhino\, and many more! The performance combines synchronized dan
 ce routines\, acrobatics\, tricks and comedy for performances that connec
 t with fans of all ages.\n\n\nShowcase Saturday\n\nA night dedicated to a
  unique theme or special appearance. Gates open at 5:30 p.m.\n\nMore Info
 : https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-vs-west-michigan-
 whitecaps-4/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-vs-west-michigan-
 whitecaps-4/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T190500
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T220500
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4373e6690c3a58155a6fed6c@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260822T074657Z
SUMMARY:SOUTH BEND CUBS VS. WEST MICHIGAN WHITECAPS
LOCATION:Four Winds Field | 501 W South St | South Bend\, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:Game Highlights:\n\nLos Cabritos Maldichos Day\n\nContinuing th
 e celebration of Latin culture\, the South Bend Cubs will become the Los 
 Cabritos Maldichos for select games this season. Join us for special pre-
 game performance celebrating Latino culture\, Latin music\, popular Latin
 o food items and more.\n\nSunday Funday\n\nArrive early for a special aut
 ograph session with the South Bend Cubs players and play catch on the fie
 ld before the game. Gates open at 12:30 p.m\n\nPromotion:\n\nThe first 1\
 ,000 kids 12 and under through the gates will receive a CareSource backpa
 ck.\n\nShowcase Saturday\n\nA night dedicated to a unique theme or specia
 l appearance. Gates open at 5:30 p.m.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsout
 hbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-vs-west-michigan-whitecaps-5/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-vs-west-michigan-
 whitecaps-5/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T140500
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T170500
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8ccad4f472ac3de806be88fa@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260822T074657Z
SUMMARY:THE POETRY DEN
LOCATION:Indiana University South Bend Civil Rights Heritage Center | 1040 
 W Washington St | South Bend\, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:The Poetry Den isn't just a space\; it’s a current\, a monthl
 y surge of voices\, both sharing and listening\, searching for something 
 beautiful.\n\nPam Blair begins each gathering with an open mic\, offering
  a stage to anyone who wants to share. It’s a place where words connect
  us\, where the rhythm of shared experience echoes in every line. Next\, 
 a featured artist steps in\, bringing a fresh perspective\, a new story\,
  and a captivating invitation to be present.\n\nFind your voice at the Po
 etry Den\, where stories connect and new perspectives bloom.\n\nMore info
 rmation at crhc.iusb.edu.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/ev
 ents/the-poetry-den/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/the-poetry-den/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260823T200000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
